// The timer of the Pico for Escapement: the fixed copy in Escapement_RP2040_Timer.cs, loaded
// over escapement_pico.repl once the timer of the models has been unregistered
// (escapement_pico.robot), since a platform description cannot redeclare a peripheral with
// another type. It counts at the 1 MHz of the chip; the wrap test raises its Frequency.
timer: Timers.EscapementRP2040Timer @ sysbus 0x40054000
    address: 0x40054000
    IRQ0 -> nvic0@0
    IRQ1 -> nvic0@1
    IRQ2 -> nvic0@2
    IRQ3 -> nvic0@3
